  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1810.01 Commercial Driver Learner Permit. A commercial driver learner permit shall be issued by the department, in accordance with the provisions of RSA 263:25 and RSA 263:88.\n\nSource. #8405, eff 8-2-05 (formerly 1807.01); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34\n\nAppendix",
